4. Ethics Conditions
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Any rights granted under this License or under any Commercial License
   are conditioned on your continuing not to use, deploy, fork, or
   modify the Software:

   (a) to extract maximal-extractable value (MEV) against users of the
       EticaHub Protocol, including but not limited to sandwich attacks
       and front-running of EticaHub-routed swaps;

   (b) to facilitate access to the EticaHub Protocol from jurisdictions
       comprehensively sanctioned by the United States Office of Foreign
       Assets Control (OFAC), namely Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria,
       and the Crimea, Donetsk, Luhansk, and Kherson regions, in any
       manner that circumvents EticaHub's geo-restriction measures;

   (c) to facilitate, promote, or distribute material depicting the
       sexual abuse or exploitation of any person under the age of
       consent in their jurisdiction (which is at all times under 18);

   (d) to design, fund, distribute, or operate weapons of mass
       destruction, including chemical, biological, radiological, or
       nuclear weapons; or

   (e) in violation of applicable law in any jurisdiction in which you
       operate or distribute.

   Violation of this Section 4 is a material breach of this License
   and any Commercial License, and terminates all rights granted to
   you immediately and without notice.

